; A ledger whose income arrives in a commodity nothing prices. The
; spending is in the operating currency, so the flows read as a pure
; loss while the cash a conversion brings in has no transaction behind
; it — the shape the trust reporting has to catch.
option "title" "Unpriced"
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-01-01 open Assets:Checking  USD
2026-01-01 open Assets:Crypto    ADA
2026-01-01 open Income:Grant     ADA
2026-01-01 open Expenses:Rent    USD

2026-01-05 * "Grant"
  Income:Grant   -60000 ADA
  Assets:Crypto

2026-01-10 * "Rent"
  Expenses:Rent  2000.00 USD
  Assets:Checking

2026-01-20 * "Convert: 50000 ADA → 30000 USD"
  Assets:Checking  30000.00 USD @@ 50000 ADA
  Assets:Crypto   -50000 ADA
